  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It makes no sense for proton email addresses to still be blocked after all these years. So many people are using it nowadays, and this is literally the only service that still doesn't support Proton. The support team suggested I make an email through a different provider - as if I would make a whole other email specifically for VRChat that I'm just going to end up forgetting the login for. I, along with so many people, don't trust the big providers like Google anymore and want as little to do with them as possible.\n\nTL;DR, please unblock Proton Mail email addresses.",
